  "description": "Habik for Women is a radiant and elegant fragrance that blends juicy fruits with delicate florals and soft musky warmth. The scent feels feminine, clean, and sophisticated with a fresh luminous character that works beautifully for everyday wear. The opening introduces bergamot and juicy pear, creating a sparkling fruity freshness that feels bright and uplifting. The heart develops into jasmine, lily of the valley, and freesia, adding soft floral elegance with a graceful airy touch. The base settles into musk, dry amber, and oakmoss, leaving a smooth, clean, and long-lasting trail that feels chic, feminine, and naturally captivating. Habik for Women is perfect for women who enjoy fresh fruity floral fragrances with a soft musky amber dry-down.",
